            "detailed_description": "<h1>Men of War II Available Now</h1><p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead the forgotten. Fight the impossible.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Men of War: Condemned Heroes</i> is a standalone entry in the acclaimed real-time tactics series, delivering one of the most intense and uncompromising portrayals of World War II. Command a Soviet penal battalion formed under the infamous Order 227 – units sent into the deadliest missions with no room for retreat or mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/ad656fbb19cccdc89a517628a95cf353.poster.avif?t=1773656451\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/ad656fbb19cccdc89a517628a95cf353.webm?t=1773656451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/ad656fbb19cccdc89a517628a95cf353.mp4?t=1773656451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on real historical accounts and veterans’ testimonies, the game follows condemned soldiers through four connected campaigns spanning <strong>1942–1945</strong> – from the desperate defenses in Volhynia and Poland to the final assault on Germany. Every mission demands precision, courage, and sacrifice, blending large-scale battlefield tactics with brutal, up-close skirmishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/dcfe2c30a4a796ea58c2321cf6992076.poster.avif?t=1773656451\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/dcfe2c30a4a796ea58c2321cf6992076.webm?t=1773656451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/dcfe2c30a4a796ea58c2321cf6992076.mp4?t=1773656451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on an enhanced <strong>GEM engine</strong>, <i>Condemned Heroes</i> introduces improved physics, visuals, and animation, making the chaos and realism of war more visceral than ever. Its unforgiving design and historical authenticity create a raw, cinematic experience that pushes players to lead with strategy and survive against impossible odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Men of War: Condemned Heroes</i> is a brutal, story-driven strategy experience about redemption, survival, and the human cost of war.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standalone campaign experience</strong> – no prior Men of War titles required.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four story-driven campaigns (1942–1945)</strong> – follow the journey of a Soviet penal unit through the Eastern Front.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Based on real events</strong> – inspired by true accounts and veterans’ stories of the Red Army’s penal battalions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced GEM engine</strong> – improved physics, destruction, animations, and visual fidelity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Eastern Front atmosphere</strong> – from uniforms and weapons to historically accurate environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical realism and challenge</strong> – every decision, every mistake, and every life matters.</p></li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead the forgotten. Fight the impossible.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Men of War: Condemned Heroes</i> is a standalone entry in the acclaimed real-time tactics series, delivering one of the most intense and uncompromising portrayals of World War II. Command a Soviet penal battalion formed under the infamous Order 227 – units sent into the deadliest missions with no room for retreat or mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/ad656fbb19cccdc89a517628a95cf353.poster.avif?t=1773656451\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/ad656fbb19cccdc89a517628a95cf353.webm?t=1773656451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/ad656fbb19cccdc89a517628a95cf353.mp4?t=1773656451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on real historical accounts and veterans’ testimonies, the game follows condemned soldiers through four connected campaigns spanning <strong>1942–1945</strong> – from the desperate defenses in Volhynia and Poland to the final assault on Germany. Every mission demands precision, courage, and sacrifice, blending large-scale battlefield tactics with brutal, up-close skirmishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/dcfe2c30a4a796ea58c2321cf6992076.poster.avif?t=1773656451\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/dcfe2c30a4a796ea58c2321cf6992076.webm?t=1773656451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204860/extras/dcfe2c30a4a796ea58c2321cf6992076.mp4?t=1773656451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on an enhanced <strong>GEM engine</strong>, <i>Condemned Heroes</i> introduces improved physics, visuals, and animation, making the chaos and realism of war more visceral than ever. Its unforgiving design and historical authenticity create a raw, cinematic experience that pushes players to lead with strategy and survive against impossible odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Men of War: Condemned Heroes</i> is a brutal, story-driven strategy experience about redemption, survival, and the human cost of war.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standalone campaign experience</strong> – no prior Men of War titles required.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four story-driven campaigns (1942–1945)</strong> – follow the journey of a Soviet penal unit through the Eastern Front.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Based on real events</strong> – inspired by true accounts and veterans’ stories of the Red Army’s penal battalions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced GEM engine</strong> – improved physics, destruction, animations, and visual fidelity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Eastern Front atmosphere</strong> – from uniforms and weapons to historically accurate environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical realism and challenge</strong> – every decision, every mistake, and every life matters.</p></li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Command a Soviet penal battalion in this standalone real-time tactics game from the Men of War series. Based on true events, Condemned Heroes delivers brutal, story-driven missions across the Eastern Front – where every order, bullet, and life matters.",
